# Node version pinned for local development AND consumed by CI
# (see .github/workflows/ci.yml -> actions/setup-node with node-version-file).
#
# Why this file exists: Node >= 24 exposes an experimental Web Storage global
# whose unconfigured accessor shadows jsdom's localStorage inside Vitest.
# That is handled in app/src/test/setup.ts, but staying on the tested major
# keeps the local run and the CI run byte-for-byte comparable.
20